    "work_id": "anf-works/tatian-fragments",
    "canonical_ref": "Tat.Frag.12.s1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Tatian, the patriarch of the Encratites, who himself rejected some of Paul’s Epistles, believed this especially, that is [addressed] to Titus,",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
