    "canonical_ref": "Tat.Frag.12.s2",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "ought to be declared to be the apostle’s, thinking little of the assertion of Marcion and others, who agree with him on this point.—Hieron.: Præf. in Com. ad Tit.",
